Notes: A 13-wide diamond with a shaded cross in the centre printed "No 7" (shown as _); two words, 33-34 and 35-36, run down the centre column above and below the cross. The number is printed in the centre block; the intro calls it "the seventh puzzle in the series". No credit is printed. Read by hand from the Milwaukee Sentinel's page (Milwaukee_Sentinel_1914_02_01_66_fun.png), solution from Milwaukee_Sentinel_1914_02_08_82.png, by Claude, 2026-11-16.


